    "title": "Garden State Parkway crash forces lane closures northbound in Holmdel - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erik Larsen ,\n3 hours ago HOLMDEL — A serious motor vehicle crash in the local northbound lanes of the Garden State Parkway just north of Exit 114 for Red Hill Road in Holmdel, according to state authorities.\nThe right and center lanes were blocked just before 8 p.m. Wednesday.\nExpect major delays on the parkway in northern Monmouth County as a result of the accident.\nThis is a developing story. Stay with app.com for updates.\nThis article originally appeared on Asbury Park Press: Garden State Parkway crash forces lane closures northbound in Holmdel\n1",
